; The driver of ppxlib with -check on a group of [@@deriving cistern] (the plan
; of phase 3, P2): the build fails if the ppx does not mark each of its
; attributes as handled, or if the deriver is not registered. Since phase 3b,
; the generated stage 1 must also compile, with each warning as an error but
; 70 (P3: the warning attribute of the generated code covers -w +a).

(library
 (name ppx_driver_check)
 (libraries cistern ptime)
 (flags
  (:standard -w @a-70))
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_cistern -check)))
